    },
    {
      "displayText": "Peluchín muestra interés por la Diancita.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500065006C00750063006800ED006E0020006D00750065007300740072006100200069006E00740065007200E9007300200070006F00720020006C00610020004400690061006E0063006900740061002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Pu, purr?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00500075002C00200070007500720072003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Espurr!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100450073007000750072007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm... Creo que se ha enterado de algo\npor telepatía.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D006D002E002E002E0020004300720065006F002000710075006500200073006500200068006100200065006E00740065007200610064006F00200064006500200061006C0067006F000A0070006F0072002000740065006C006500700061007400ED0061002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Verás, Peluchín es capaz de transmitir\npensamientos de una mente a otra.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es una habilidad increíble, pero le pasa factura.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPor eso siempre le pido que intente usarla lo\nmenos posible, pero a veces los pensamientos<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nle vienen sin querer, como ahora.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 185
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me pregunto qué habrá descubierto...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¿Será que la Diancita albergaba algún\npensamiento? Qué curioso...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Creo que deberíamos seguir a Peluchín para\nllegar al fondo del asunto.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Parece que está percibiendo algo...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006100720065006300650020007100750065002000650073007400E1002000700065007200630069006200690065006E0064006F00200061006C0067006F002E002E002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espera un momento.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006100200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hola, Bibi!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10048006F006C0061002C00200042006900620069002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mira, estoy en mitad de una investigación con\nPeluchín y creo que necesito tu ayuda.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avisa a Trini y Mani también, porfa. ¡Hasta luego!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410076006900730061002000610020005400720069006E0069002000790020004D0061006E0069002000740061006D0062006900E9006E002C00200070006F007200660061002E002000A1004800610073007400610020006C007500650067006F002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perdona. Eran unos compañeros con los que\nllevamos colaborando bastante tiempo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Ah, sí?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00410068002C0020007300ED003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Tienes compañeros?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005400690065006E0065007300200063006F006D0070006100F100650072006F0073003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sí, verás, digamos que heredé la agencia de un\ndetective llamado Handsome.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Por eso se llama así la agencia!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10050006F0072002000650073006F0020007300650020006C006C0061006D006100200061007300ED0020006C00610020006100670065006E00630069006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El que da nombre a la agencia, ¿no?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C00200071007500650020006400610020006E006F006D006200720065002000610020006C00610020006100670065006E006300690061002C002000BF006E006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eso es. Era un hombre muy amable del que\naprendí muchas cosas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073006F002000650073002E002000450072006100200075006E00200068006F006D0062007200650020006D0075007900200061006D00610062006C0065002000640065006C0020007100750065000A0061007000720065006E006400ED0020006D0075006300680061007300200063006F007300610073002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero, como trabaja también para la Policía\nInternacional, tuvo que marcharse para ocuparse<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nde un caso...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 112
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que no me quedó otra que pedirles ayuda a\nesos compañeros y a Peluchín para poder seguir<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncon la agencia.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 116
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La verdad es que no habría podido hacerlo sin\nPeluchín. ¡La de casos que hemos podido resolver<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ngracias a sus poderes telepáticos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 137
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero, como ya te conté antes, usarlos le causa\nmucha fatiga.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006F002C00200063006F006D006F00200079006100200074006500200063006F006E007400E900200061006E007400650073002C00200075007300610072006C006F00730020006C0065002000630061007500730061000A006D00750063006800610020006600610074006900670061002E00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Pu, purr?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00500075002C00200070007500720072003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Espurr!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
